        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Incredible service from the Prenato team! My appointment and results were both amazingly quick, I had such a pleasant experience overall I wouldn't hesitate to recommend this place. Thanks team!",
        "time": 1698076784,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "S Michalovic",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113993690720843089955/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW_XTgC2cVguCn7uLnX_QonYH7j_o-x5d4jmQQbWjuPvAG0cPrXeQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Very professional team. I was screened for Down syndrome early in my pregnancy. Everything went well and I was able to find out the sex of my baby at the same time. The package includes an hour of support with a nurse that I booked after my baby was born when I needed help with breastfeeding. The nurse was very helpful and reassuring. Thank you to the whole team!",
        "time": 1692735841,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Julie Lalonde",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116782188674184399888/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUz2c9b47lx3tTtF_3EeP1MGZ6mINj1Ws2kgi9nTybo7DR4PucdEg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Incredible service. I had fetal DNA blood tests done twice at this clinic (Vaudreuil) and wow, wow, wow! The nurse listens to you and makes you feel like a VIP. Plus, I got a call on a Sunday with my results! I highly recommend this clinic.",
        "time": 1696936646,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Josianne Leduc",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108434195210877150528/reviews",
        "language": "fr",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXGjbLX0uexzOK98A8Ham9mnKlHkFCXa0bM2OkuVpdHb2ul0x-K=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "En partenariat avec Radimed Vaudreuil, j'ai eu une excellente expérience. Les echos sont super claires et tu repars avec une 20 aines de photos de tous ses membres. La technicienne que j'ai eu était merveilleuse et m'a fait sentir bien.  Honnêtement si vous êtes en mesure de débourser les sous faites le, c'est une belle expérience à vivre, plusieurs assurances peuvent couvrir. Les adjointes administratives au téléphone sont superbes.",
        "time": 1661435132,
        "translated": false
      },
